    "family_reading": {
        "text": "AionLabs Aion is an API only, text in and text out family with 6 versions listed. Across the whole family, 5 of 6 versions support reasoning and none publish open weights, so you cannot self host any of it. Context windows run from 32768 to 262144 tokens, and the newest versions pair a 262144 token window with a 32768 token output cap. Pricing splits into tiers: the Mini models cost $0.7 per million input and $1.4 output, the full 3.5 and 3.0 cost $3 and $6, and the older 2.0 and RP 1.0 sit at $0.8 and $1.6. The facts suggest the family suits long document and reasoning heavy text work where an API is acceptable, with Mini as the cheaper option. Limits are the lack of open weights, text only input, and the higher cost of the full tiers.",
